      "review_description": "Jhana was hard to contact at times.  I paid half the cost of the system in early December 2016 and had to really push to get in installed by late February 2017.  I realise that there was the Christmas break and there was a delay on getting the inverters but the lack of communication was not good.  I had to chase him to submit the paper work to the power authority, who I work for, so I could get the system hooked to the grid. If I hadn't I'm not sure how long it would have taken.  I know he is busy but don't take the work on if you can't do it in a timely manner.",
